{"page":507,"width":1671,"height":2485,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"568","words":[{"text":"568","x":169,"y":142,"width":59,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":298,"y":145,"width":116,"height":27},{"text":"12","x":426,"y":147,"width":36,"height":21},{"text":"입출력","x":490,"y":147,"width":62,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":561,"y":150,"width":62,"height":24}]},{"text":"설명한다. 이 그림은 하나의 입출력 작업이 엄청나게 많은 CPU 사이#(cycle)을 시용","words":[{"text":"설명한다.","x":300,"y":265,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":445,"y":266,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"그림은","x":486,"y":267,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"하나의","x":589,"y":267,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"입출력","x":690,"y":267,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"작업이","x":791,"y":267,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"엄청나게","x":896,"y":267,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":1032,"y":269,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"CPU","x":1107,"y":272,"width":77,"height":27},{"text":"사이#(cycle)을","x":1201,"y":267,"width":240,"height":39},{"text":"시용","x":1456,"y":267,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"하며 많은 단계를 거친다는 것을 보여주고 있다.","words":[{"text":"하며","x":298,"y":321,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":371,"y":321,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"단계를","x":442,"y":322,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"거친다는","x":542,"y":323,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"것을","x":670,"y":322,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"보여주고","x":737,"y":322,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":870,"y":322,"width":64,"height":35}]},{"text":"1. 한 프로세스가 앞서 오픈된 파일의 파일 디스크립터에 봉쇄형 read 시스템 콜을","words":[{"text":"1.","x":325,"y":410,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"한","x":372,"y":406,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"프로세스가","x":416,"y":407,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"앞서","x":579,"y":406,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"오픈된","x":650,"y":406,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"파일의","x":752,"y":406,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":855,"y":406,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"디스크립터에","x":931,"y":406,"width":184,"height":36},{"text":"봉쇄형","x":1133,"y":408,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"read","x":1247,"y":413,"width":78,"height":24},{"text":"시스템","x":1343,"y":406,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"콜을","x":1455,"y":409,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"요청한다.","words":[{"text":"요청한다.","x":371,"y":463,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"2. 커널 안에 있는 시스템 콜 코드는 그 인지(argument)를 검사한다. read의 경우에,","words":[{"text":"2.","x":323,"y":523,"width":25,"height":25},{"text":"커널","x":373,"y":519,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"안에","x":442,"y":520,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":513,"y":520,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":581,"y":519,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"콜","x":677,"y":521,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"코드는","x":717,"y":521,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"그","x":817,"y":525,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"인지(argument)를","x":860,"y":520,"width":270,"height":40},{"text":"검사한다.","x":1143,"y":521,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"read의","x":1294,"y":520,"width":105,"height":34},{"text":"경우에,","x":1416,"y":520,"width":100,"height":37}]},{"text":"자료가 이미 버퍼 개시에 들어있으면 그 자료를 반환하고 입출력 요구는 끝난다.","words":[{"text":"자료가","x":370,"y":576,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"이미","x":472,"y":577,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼","x":541,"y":577,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"개시에","x":610,"y":576,"width":83,"height":36},{"text":"들어있으면","x":706,"y":577,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":867,"y":583,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"자료를","x":908,"y":577,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"반환하고","x":1012,"y":577,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"입출력","x":1153,"y":578,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"요구는","x":1262,"y":579,"width":101,"height":33},{"text":"끝난다.","x":1374,"y":578,"width":103,"height":34}]},{"text":"3. 없으면 실제의 1℃ad가 필요하다. 이때 그 프로세스는 실행 큐에서 대기 큐로 옮겨","words":[{"text":"3.","x":322,"y":638,"width":25,"height":26},{"text":"없으면","x":372,"y":634,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"실제의","x":473,"y":635,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"1℃ad가","x":571,"y":634,"width":96,"heigh