eight":34},{"text":"통해","x":691,"y":1214,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"해당","x":763,"y":1214,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트","x":836,"y":1215,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"핸들러가","x":969,"y":1215,"width":127,"height":33},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1111,"y":1214,"width":163,"height":34},{"text":"받고,","x":1286,"y":1214,"width":75,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":1375,"y":1214,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"드라","x":1452,"y":1215,"width":64,"height":34}]},{"text":"이버에 신호를 보내며, 인터럽트로부터 되돌아온다.","words":[{"text":"이버에","x":368,"y":1272,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"신호를","x":467,"y":1273,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"보내며,","x":561,"y":1272,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트로부터","x":671,"y":1272,"width":204,"height":35},{"text":"되돌아온다.","x":891,"y":1272,"width":162,"height":34}]},{"text":"8. 신호를 받은 장치 드라이버는 어떤 입출력이 완성되었는지를 확인하고, 커널 입출","words":[{"text":"8.","x":322,"y":1333,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"신호를","x":368,"y":1329,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"받은","x":467,"y":1330,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"장치","x":536,"y":1330,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"드라이버는","x":606,"y":1329,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":768,"y":1329,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"입출력이","x":842,"y":1329,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"완성되었는지를","x":974,"y":1328,"width":228,"height":35},{"text":"확인하고,","x":1214,"y":1328,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":1375,"y":1328,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"입출","x":1455,"y":1329,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"력 서브시스템에게 그 요구가 완료되었음을 알려준다.","words":[{"text":"력","x":370,"y":1387,"width":23,"height":34},{"text":"서브시스템에게","x":408,"y":1387,"width":199,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":620,"y":1392,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"요구가","x":659,"y":1386,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"완료되었음을","x":760,"y":1386,"width":183,"height":36},{"text":"알려준다.","x":955,"y":1386,"width":131,"height":34}]},{"text":"9. 커널은 자신의 버퍼로부터 요구된 프로세스의 버퍼로 데이터를 옮기고 그 프로세","words":[{"text":"9.","x":323,"y":1449,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"커널은","x