 작업에 CPU를 할당한다. 그 프로세스는 이제 시스템 콜에서","words":[{"text":"줄러가","x":369,"y":1617,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"언젠가는","x":471,"y":1617,"width":113,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":597,"y":1618,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"작업에","x":638,"y":1618,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"CPU를","x":738,"y":1619,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"할당한다.","x":854,"y":1617,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":999,"y":1621,"width":33,"height":23},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1044,"y":1614,"width":163,"height":34},{"text":"이제","x":1223,"y":1613,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":1304,"y":1613,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"콜에서","x":1418,"y":1615,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"복귀한 것이다.","words":[{"text":"복귀한","x":369,"y":1675,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":468,"y":1675,"width":90,"height":34}]},{"text":"12.6 STREAMS","words":[{"text":"12.6","x":173,"y":1810,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"STREAMS","x":316,"y":1809,"width":180,"height":32}]},{"text":"UNIX 시스템 Ⅵ그리고 많은 후속 UNIX 릴리스)는 STREMS라 불리는 흥미로운 기","words":[{"text":"UNIX","x":296,"y":1901,"width":89,"height":27},{"text":"시스템","x":398,"y":1898,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"Ⅵ그리고","x":494,"y":1899,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":627,"y":1899,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"후속","x":696,"y":1899,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"UNIX","x":766,"y":1902,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"릴리스)는","x":872,"y":1898,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"STREMS라","x":1018,"y":1897,"width":190,"height":35},{"text":"불리는","x":1220,"y":1897,"width":103,"height":34},{"text":"흥미로운","x":1336,"y":1897,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"기","x":1485,"y":1898,"width":25,"height":34}]},{"text":"법을 가지고 있는데, 그것은 응용 프로그램이 동적으로 드라이버 코드의 파이프라인을","words":[{"text":"법을","x":299,"y":1954,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"가지고","x":371,"y":1955,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"있는데,","x":472,"y":1955,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"그것은","x":576,"y":1955,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"응용","x":675,"y":1955,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램이","x":748,"y":1955,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"동적으로","x":913,"y":1955,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"드라이버","x":1052,"y":1955,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"코드의","x":1198,"y":1954,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"파이프라인을","x":1315,"y":1954,"width":200,"height":35}]},{"text":"조립할 수 있게 한다. 스트림은 디바이스 드라이버와 싸우자 레벨 프로세스 사이의 완전","words":[{"text":"조립할","x":297,"y":2011,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":396,"y":2012,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있게","x":439,"y":2011,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":504,"y":2011,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"스트림은","x":580,"y":2012,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"디바이스","x":708,"y":2011,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"드라이버와","x":836,"y":2012,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"싸우자","x":1001,"y":2012,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"레벨","x":1111,"y":2013,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스","x":1187,"y":2013,"width":137,"height":34},{"text":"사이의","x":1336,"y":2012,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"완전","x":1450,"y":2012,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"양방향 연결을 말한다. 스트림은 사용자 프로세스와 상호 연동하는 스트림 헤드와 디바","words":[{"text":"양방향","x":298,"y":2068,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"연결을","x":400,"y":2068,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"말한다.","x":496,"y":2068,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"스트림은","x":601,"y":2069,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"사용자","x":728,"y":2068,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스와","x":830,"y":2069,"width":153,"height":34},{"text":"상호","x":995,"y":2070,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"연동하는","x":1074,"y":2070,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"스트림","x":1217,"y":2070,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"헤드와","x":1334,"y":2070,"width":103,"height":34},{"text":"디바","x":1452,"y":2070,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"이스를 제어하는 드라이버 엔드, 그 둘 사이에 존재하는 0개 이상의 스트림 모듈로 구성","words":[{"text":"이스를","x":298,"y":2124,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"제어하는","x":397,"y":2125,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"드라이버","x":522,"y":2124,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"엔드,","x":648,"y":2124,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"그",